			"notes": {
				"rationale": "Entschuldigung, said to a stranger before a question, is the apology formula, one word, so it is a Lexeme INTJ. The noun die Entschuldigung is another Lemma (Sie besteht auf einer Entschuldigung). Entschuldigung! before a stranger is asked something is Duden's 'Höflichkeitsformel' asking for forbearance, an apology for the intrusion, so it takes the 🙇 of the NOUN Entschuldigung."
